      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Recruitment Team (MVP)\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Form: Job Description + CVs (PDF)\n2. Supervisor Agent: kay7ll l Job w kay7added criteria\n3. CV Screening Agent: kaystakhrej profile mn kol CV (JSON)\n4. Job Matching Agent: score + evidence + missing skills\n5. Report Agent: rapport final + drafts dial messages\n\n**Mohim:** l AI kay3awn ghir f tanzim. Lqarar nihaei dyal recruiter. Ma kaysift hta message bla mowafaqa.\n\n**Bach tkhdem:** zid credential dyal LLM f les 4 nodes 'OpenAI ...' (ola bddlhom b Gemini / Claude / Ollama).",
