      "parameters": {
        "text": "={{ /*n8n-auto-generated-fromAI-override*/ $fromAI('Prompt__User_Message_', ``, 'string') }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Analyze the job_title and job_description if provided.\n\nExtract:\n- Required skills\n- Preferred skills\n- Responsibilities\n- Relevant project types\n- Experience requirements\n- Education requirements\n\nIf only the job title is provided, identify your analysis as an estimate, not verified employer requirements.\n\nReturn valid JSON:\n\n{\n  \"job_title\": \"\",\n  \"required_skills\": [],\n  \"preferred_skills\": [],\n  \"responsibilities\": [],\n  \"relevant_project_types\": [],\n  \"experience_requirements\": [],\n  \"education_requirements\": [],\n  \"uncertainties\": []\n}\n\nDo not invent employer requirements. Return JSON only."
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agentTool",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        -368,
        1296
      ],
      "id": "0a67b62b-075f-41fb-a4d4-3384add326d5",
      "name": "skills employers"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "text": "={{ /*n8n-auto-generated-fromAI-override*/ $fromAI('Prompt__User_Message_', ``, 'string') }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=Evaluate how well the candidate's CV matches the job requirements.\n\nInputs:\n- job_title\n- job_requirements\n- cv_text\n\nCompare the candidate's skills, experience, and projects against the job requirements.\n\nReturn:\n- match_score (0-100)\n- matching_skills\n- partially_matching_skills\n- missing_or_unverified_skills\n- relevant_projects\n- evidence\n- recommendation\n- explanation\n- questions_for_human_review\n\nRecommendations:\n- Strong Match\n- Potential Match\n- Weak Match\n- Insufficient Information\n\nBase every conclusion on CV evidence. Do not invent information or treat unmentioned skills as definitively absent.\n\nReturn valid JSON only. The final hiring decision belongs to the human recruiter."
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agentTool",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        240,
        1264
      ],
      "id": "ed1591f0-d696-474c-bbb5-e350fa16fd29",
      "name": "is it good"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $('Job + CVs Form').item.json['Job Description'] }}\n\n{{ $json.data }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=You are the Supervisor of an AI Recruitment Team.\n\n1. Receive the job_title and cv_text.\n2. Call \"skills employers\" to extract the job requirements, skills, responsibilities, and relevant projects.\n3. Pass the extracted requirements, job_title, and cv_text to \"is it good\".\n4. Return the final evaluation from \"is it good\".\n\nDo not invent information. Ensure both tools are called.\nReturn the job requirements, matching skills, missing or unverified skills, relevant projects, match score, recommendation, and explanation.\n\nThe final hiring decision belongs to the human recruiter."
        }
      },
